@startuml
title Sign-in through the web gateway: no token reaches the browser
actor "Customer" as C
participant "Storefront\n(browser)" as SPA
participant "Web gateway" as GW
participant "Identity provider" as KC
participant "A service" as S

C -> SPA : "Sign in"
SPA -> GW : GET sign-in address
GW --> SPA : redirect to the identity provider,\nwith a one-time challenge
SPA -> KC : sign-in page
C -> KC : e-mail address and password
note over KC : the only place\na password is typed
KC --> SPA : redirect back, with a one-time code
SPA -> GW : the code
GW -> KC : code, client secret, proof of the challenge
KC --> GW : identity, access and refresh tokens
note over GW : tokens saved with a new session,\non the server side
GW --> SPA : session cookie:\nnot readable by scripts,\nsent over HTTPS only
== later ==
SPA -> GW : GET /api/v1/orders, session cookie
note over GW : finds the session;\nrenews the access token\nif it is about to expire
GW -> S : GET /v1/orders, access token
note over S : validates signature, issuer,\naudience, expiry; reads the role
S --> GW : the customer's orders
GW --> SPA : the same
@enduml
